# WApp architecture

Travel app (Worldener). Stack: RN 0.81, Redux Toolkit, React Navigation 7, Axios → `{URL}/api/v1/user`, Stripe, FCM, Socket.IO.

**Deep reference:** `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. **API layer:** `docs/API.md`. Product flows: `APP_FEATURES.md`.

## Entry

`index.js` → `App.js` (Provider, StripeAppBridge, push, Routes, toast) → `src/navigation/Routes.jsx` (Auth vs Main by `user.accessToken`).

## Where to put code

| Change | Location |
|--------|----------|
| Screen | `src/screens/` + export `screens/index.js` + `navigationStrings` + stack registration |
| API | `endpoints.js` → `api/services/*` → slice thunk |
| Shared UI | `src/components/` |
| Config / flags | `src/config/` |
| Guest gate | `GUEST_RESTRICTED_SCREENS` in `utils/authHelpers.js` |

## Imports

Use Babel aliases: `@api`, `@assets`, `@components`, `@config`, `@context`, `@hooks`, `@mocks`, `@navigation`, `@redux`, `@screens`, `@services`, `@utils`.

## Do not

- Invent a second HTTP client (use `apiClient`)
- Call reusable-group mocks from screens (use `crewGroupsService`)
- Skip `pod install` in `ios/` after native deps (`automaticPodsInstallation: false`)
- Change `.env` without restarting Metro (`babel-plugin-inline-dotenv`)
